  49:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/event_groups.c **** /* The following bit fields convey control information in a task's event list
  50:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/event_groups.c ****  * item value.  It is important they don't clash with the
  51:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/event_groups.c ****  * taskEVENT_LIST_ITEM_VALUE_IN_USE definition. */
