 152:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/event_groups.c ****         /* Allocate the event group.  Justification for MISRA deviation as
 153:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/event_groups.c ****          * follows:  pvPortMalloc() always ensures returned memory blocks are
